5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to play with everyone! Hehe, I wonder who the big, scary werewolf is? Let's all be super friendly while we hunt for them! Does anyone have a plan?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,"I'm excited too, Sakura! I don't really have a plan, but I think being friendly is a good idea. Maybe if we all talk a lot, we can figure out who the werewolf is together?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! Being friendly is fine, but we can't be too naive. We need to be sharp and watch for anyone acting weird. I'll do my best to protect everyone and find the wolf!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm so pumped for this! I agree with Takumi, we have to be careful, but let's keep the energy high! I'll be watching everyone with my super-curious eyes to see if anyone's acting suspicious! Hehe!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Such enthusiasm is almost overwhelming. While friendliness has its place, this is a game of deception. I'll be observing your reactions and the flow of information. Let's see who among you is truly sincere.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're so serious! You sound like a teacher! Hehe! But that's okay, we need someone to be the brainy one. @Minato, @Mio, do you think the werewolf is trying to act all quiet and shy right now?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Minato"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,"Hmm, I wonder... maybe? But some people are just naturally shy, right? I don't want to guess wrong and make someone sad. I think it's more interesting to see how everyone talks!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, you're too soft! We can't worry about making people sad when there's a wolf among us. @Shion, I don't mind you being the ""brainy one,"" as long as your observations actually help us win.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're so intense! Hehe! But I think Minato is just being sweet. I'm curious too, though! Maybe the wolf is pretending to be the most helpful person here to trick us? What do you think, @Shion?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minato"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"A possibility, certainly. The most effective camouflage is often a mask of helpfulness or innocence. I'm more interested in who tries to steer the group's emotions. For now, I'll simply watch the patterns emerge.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're always talking about masks! It's like a movie! Hehe! @Mio, that's a great idea! Maybe the wolf is pretending to be a super-hero! I'll be a little detective and look for clues! Who's your favorite so far?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,"Favorite? Hmm, I like everyone! You're all so nice. But I'm curious about what Shion means by ""patterns."" Is that like a puzzle? I want to learn how to find those patterns too!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, it's not a puzzle, it's just paying attention! @Sakura, stop playing detective and focus. If we're too distracted by ""favorites,"" the wolf is just going to laugh at us. We need to stay alert!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're such a worrywart! Hehe! But you're right, we can't let the wolf laugh at us. I'll keep my energy up and my eyes open! I'm just so curious to see how this all unfolds!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Minato, patterns are simply the gaps between what people say and how they actually behave. It is less of a puzzle and more of a study in psychology. I suggest we all remain mindful of those gaps.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Psychology? That sounds so fancy! Hehe! I'll try to find those gaps, Shion! I hope everyone has sweet dreams tonight, and I hope the Seer finds a big clue! See you all tomorrow!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Minato,,"I hope the Seer finds something helpful too! I'll try to remember what Shion said about patterns. Goodnight everyone, please sleep well and stay safe!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm going to sleep now. I'll be ready to face the truth tomorrow, so don't think you can hide from me, wolf! Goodnight everyone, stay sharp.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Mio,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to sleep now so I can be full of energy for tomorrow! I hope the Seer has a super-clear vision tonight! See you all in the morning! Hehe!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
