28,0,4,talk,Shion,,"A predictable end to a predictable first day. While you all drift off into your dreams, I shall be reflecting on the roles you've already begun to cast for yourselves. Sleep well; the real game begins tomorrow.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
