36,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Good morning everyone! Hehe, I slept like a log! I wonder if the Seer found something super spooky or super helpful last night? @everyone, does anyone have a secret they want to share? I'm all ears!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Good morning, Sakura! I slept well too. I'm really curious about what the Seer found. If you're the Seer, do you feel safe enough to tell us, or should we wait a little bit?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, we can't just wait around! If the Seer knows who the wolf is, they should tell us now so we can stop them. Why be afraid? Let's just get the truth out there!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Good morning! Hehe, I'm wide awake and ready! @Takumi, you're so bold! But if the Seer tells us everything right away, the wolf might get scared and attack them tonight! We have to be careful, right?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Shion,,Mio is correct. Takumi's eagerness to expose the Seer is a dangerous impulse. Forcing a reveal only provides the werewolf with a target. I'm curious if this boldness is genuine or a calculated attempt to eliminate our most valuable asset.,"{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're doing it again! Making everything sound like a secret mission! Hehe! @Takumi, don't be too grumpy! Maybe the Seer is just shy? If you were the Seer, would you tell us right away?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I think I would be a little scared... I wouldn't want the werewolf to be mean to me. But I'd want to help everyone! @Takumi, maybe we can just wait and see if the Seer wants to speak?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, I'm not being grumpy, I'm being realistic! If we're too scared to act, we're just waiting to be eaten. @Shion, stop analyzing me and start helping! I'm just saying we should be brave and find the wolf!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, being brave is great, but being smart is better! Hehe! If we just rush in, we might make a mistake. I'm curious, does anyone else feel like we should wait for a hint instead of a full reveal?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Shion,,"A hint is a fragile thing, Mio; it can be easily twisted by a wolf to mislead the village. However, I agree that a full reveal is premature. @Takumi, your insistence on haste is becoming quite conspicuous. Why are you so desperate for a name?","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're so scary when you're being a detective! Hehe! @Takumi, maybe you're just really, really excited to win? But @Mio's idea about hints sounds like a fun game! @everyone, if you're the Seer, can you give us a tiny, teeny clue?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Minato,,"A tiny clue sounds like a good idea! It would be like a little puzzle for us to solve together. @everyone, if you can give us a hint without being in danger, I think that would be very helpful!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, @Minato, this isn't a game! Hints just waste time and let the wolf confuse us more. If the Seer is too scared to speak, then we have to rely on our own eyes. Who's actually acting suspicious here?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're so serious! Hehe! But since you're asking, I'm starting to wonder why you're pushing us to be so hasty. It's almost like you want to rush us into a mistake! Does anyone else feel that way?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, your intuition is aligning with my observations. Takumi's aggression is a convenient shield; by framing his haste as ""bravery,"" he attempts to silence caution. It is a classic tactic to force a premature decision.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, @Mio, you're both ganging up on Takumi! Hehe! But wait... if Takumi is just being a loud-mouth, maybe the real wolf is someone being super quiet? I'm getting a little confused! Who should we vote for? This is so hard!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I don't want anyone to be sad, but @Takumi is being very loud... it's a little scary. But @Shion said the wolf could be hiding too. I'm not sure who to pick. Does anyone have a better idea?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, @Mio, stop trying to twist my words! I'm the only one actually trying to find the wolf instead of playing games or analyzing ""patterns."" If you're so sure I'm the wolf, then vote for me and see! I'm not hiding anything!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, that's a very bold challenge! Hehe! But just because you're not hiding doesn't mean you're not the wolf. I'm still super curious about why you're so pushy! I think we should be careful!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Takumi, your challenge is a transparent attempt to appear innocent through bravado. By daring us to vote for you, you hope to frame any suspicion as an unfair attack. I find your lack of subtlety quite revealing. I'm voting for Takumi.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
